>  50, 60, 68, 79, 81, 82, 83, 85)
(6,391 real changes made)

. 
. * Africa
. replace birth_continent = 3 if inlist(corigin, 30, 47, 48, 49, 52, 54, 67, 84
> , 89, 98, 102, 111, 113, 125, 166)
(8,645 real changes made)

. 
. * North America
. replace birth_continent = 4 if inlist(corigin, 18, 55, 61)
(300 real changes made)

. 
. * South America
. replace birth_continent = 5 if inlist(corigin, 64, 117, 133)
(59 real changes made)

. 
. * Oceania (Australia, etc.)
. replace birth_continent = 6 if corigin == 41
(2 real changes made)

. 
. * Unknown or other countries
. replace birth_continent = 7 if birth_continent == .
(1,908 real changes made)

. 
. * Define the label "continents"
. label define continents 1 "Europe" 2 "Asia" 3 "Africa" 4 "North America" 5 "S
> outh America" 6 "Oceania" 7 "Unknown"

. 
. * Assign label values using the label "continents"
. label values birth_continent continents

